      "widgets_values": [
        "Reference mapping for attached images after the grid reference:\nnano1.png is nano. Keep nano's face, hair, outfit, and body identity consistent.\nsoman.png is soman. Keep soman's face, hair, outfit, and body identity consistent.\ngun3.png is the gun design. Soman uses two matching pistols based on gun3.\nbuilding.png is the building construction site environment. Use it for the location, scaffolding, concrete, steel, dust, and work lights.\n\n1. Establishing shot inside a building construction site: soman holds two gun3-style pistols and faces nano across dusty concrete, tense cinematic comic framing.\n2. Soman rushes forward with the twin pistols while nano moves in close, beginning a hand-to-hand fight among scaffolding and building materials.\n3. Nano and soman trade heavy close-range blows, soman still gripping both pistols, construction workers' gear and exposed beams around them.\n4. Tight action panel: nano locks soman's wrist and twists one pistol away during the melee.\n5. Extreme close-up: nano's hand ejects the magazine from the gun, metal details sharp, fingers tense, no text.\n6. The magazine tumbles through dusty air and hits the construction floor, sparks and debris around it.\n7. Soman overpowers nano and pins nano against concrete or scaffolding, still dangerous despite the missing magazine.\n8. Soman appears to have subdued nano, looming over them in the construction site, dramatic shadows and hard rim light.\n9. Nano dissolves from soman's grip like black smoke, body breaking into swirling dark vapor.\n10. Soman turns in shock as nano reappears standing directly in front of him, calm and impossible.\n11. Nano smiles wickedly, raising one hand as black smoke pours from the fingers, soman frozen in alarm.\n12. Final panel: black smoke floods outward from nano's hand and covers the frame, swallowing the construction site, ominous ending, no captions.",
        3,
        4,
        1920,
        1080,
        4,
        false
      ]
    },
